    "https://www.csusm.edu/careers/index.html": {
      "title": "Career Center",
      "description": "Career Center events | Career Center | CSUSM skip to main content skip to navigation myCSUSM COUGAR COURSES EMAIL MS OFFICE APPS PASSWORD MANAGEMENT Your Account: Logout skip to current link Site Menu Career Services Handshake Cougar Connect Mentorship Career Counseling Online Resources FAQ Signature Programs Cougar Career Champions Free Professional Clothing at the Cougar Closet Free Headshots Employment Post a Job or Internship Campus Student Employment Employer Engagement Program Handshake Internships For Students Credit Internships For Employers & Community Partners Credit Internships How to Develop a Impactful Internship Post a For-Credit Internship Timelines and Important Dates Engage with CSUSM For Faculty Panetta Congressional Internship Connect With Us Contact Careers Request a Presentation Contact Academic Advising FAQ skip to main content skip to section navigation myCSUSM COUGAR COURSES EMAIL MS OFFICE APPS PASSWORD MANAGEMENT Your Account: Logout CAMPUS APPS Career Center Career Services Signature Programs Employment Internships Connect With Us Handshake Cougar Connect Mentorship Career Counseling Online Resources FAQ Cougar Career Champions Free Professional Clothing at the Cougar Closet Free Headshots Post a Job or Internship Campus Student Employment Recruiting On Campus Employer Engagement Program Handshake Internship Information For Students For Employers & Community Partners For Faculty Panetta Congressional Internship Contact Careers Career Center Team Request a Presentation Contact Academic Advising FAQ Career Center Services Take advantage of CSUSM Career Center services to help you successfully transition\n                              from college to the world of work. Let our professional staff help you in this important\n                              process that will impact your life after Cal State San Marcos. We look forward to\n                              working with you! Students, Book an Appointment Now! CSUSM Career Services Handshake Make appointments, search for jobs, RSVP for events, resume/cover letter critiques\n                                    and more! Employers, recruit CSUSM students and Alumni. Handshake Information Upcoming Events chat loading... Contact Us Administrative Building 1400 333 S. Twin Oaks Valley Road San Marcos, CA 92096 careers@csusm.edu (760)750-4900 Follow Us Hours of Operation Monday - Friday: 8:00 am-5:00 pm Edit this page Non-Discrimination Statement Privacy Accessibility"
