    "https://careersmanager.pageuppeople.com/873/sm/en-us/job/554268/custodial-pool": {
      "title": "CSUSM Recruitment",
      "description": "CSUSM Recruitment - Details - Custodial Pool skip to main content skip to navigation skip to current link Site Menu Job Opportunities Staff and Management Careers Faculty Careers CSUSM Corporation Careers Student Employment Pay and Benefits Benefits Portal Employment and Compensation About About San Marcos skip to main content skip to section navigation CSUSM Recruitment Job Opportunities Pay and Benefits About Staff and Management Careers Faculty Careers CSUSM Corporation Careers Student Employment Benefits Portal Employment and Compensation About San Marcos CSUSM Recruitment Great Minds Doing Great Work EXISTING APPLICANT LOGIN Custodial Pool Apply now Job no: 554268 Work type: Staff Location: San Marcos Categories: Unit 5 - CSUEU - Operations and Support Services, Custodial/Facilities, Temporary, Time Varies, On-site (work in-person at business location) Custodial Pool Applications are being accepted to fill short-term temporary, Custodian positions across our campus with the possibility of eventual permanent hire. Positions may last from one day to several months. This applicant pool will be used to fill vacant positions on an as-needed basis throughout the year. To view a sample position description, click here: Custodian Positions may be eligible for a broad range of benefits, including medical, dental, vision, life and disability insurances, retirement (CalPERS), tuition waiver, vacation and sick leave. In addition, 15 paid holidays are offered each year; 14 scheduled on specific days and a Personal Holiday that may be taken any time during the year. A comprehensive benefits summary for this position is available online by visiting our Benefits Portal . Compensation Lead Custodian Salary Range: $3,596 - $5,035 per month Custodian Salary Range: $3,461 - $4,752 per month Work Schedule / Hours 1st Shift: Monday - Friday / 7:00am to 3:30pm 2nd Shift: Tuesday - Saturday / 2:30pm to 11:00pm (3-day training on 1st Shift / 7:00am to 3:30pm) 3rd 